    "summary": "Embarked models can have active abilities, subject to each ability’s requirements. An ability needing sight or measurement to a different unit fails because the passengers are off the battlefield. For example, Azrael cannot enhance the TRANSPORT’s shots via Supreme Grand Master. Firing Deck makes the TRANSPORT the bearer of those weapons.",
